			<attribute key="label" type="String">By now, we learnt the following 5 things.

1. How to take input as a string
2. How to store a value
3. How to convert a string to an integer
4. How to do operations such as addition, multiplication, division etc. on numbers
5. How to display output

Using these, you can write a program and run it. First write the program on a paper and after that type it in your computer.</attribute>
